	STSET PTR,XTR,XTRX,20
	JPL I (WHUSR; STA USNO,B
	LDT I (CMDLN; LDX CPTR,B; SAA 24; JPL I (PCF; JMP SSS
	LDX CPTR,B; JPL I (GCI; JMP SFF
	SAT ##(; SKP IF DA UEQ ST; JMP S2
	LDX CPTR,B; JPL I (WCD; JMP SFF; JMP S4
S2,	LDX CPTR,B; JPL I (GCI; JMP SFF
	SAT ##); SKP IF DA UEQ ST; JMP S3
	LDX PTR,B; JPL I (WCI; JMP SFF; JMP S2
